    {
      "id": "a5676ec61494",
      "name": "交易日历-Tushare同步",
      "prompt": "执行以下 Python 脚本，从 Tushare trade_cal API 同步 A股交易日历到 stock_data.db（每年1月1日执行，全量覆盖当年全年日历；如中途有临时调整，可实时拉取更新）：\n\n1. 运行：\n   cd ~/my_quant_system && ~/.pyenv/versions/3.11.11/bin/python3 -c \"\nimport sqlite3, os, time\nfrom datetime import datetime\nimport tushare as ts\n\ntoken = os.environ.get('TUSHARE_TOKEN', '')\nif not token:\n    env_file = os.path.expanduser('~/.hermes/.env.tushare')\n    if os.path.exists(env_file):\n        with open(env_file) as f:\n            for line in f:\n                line = line.strip()\n                if line.startswith('TUSHARE_TOKEN='):\n                    token = line.split('=', 1)[1].strip().strip('\\\"')\n                    break\nts.set_token(token)\npro = ts.pro_api()\n\nDB = os.path.expanduser('~/my_quant_system/stock_data.db')\nconn = sqlite3.connect(DB)\n\n# 全量覆盖当年（每年1月1日执行，INSERT OR REPLACE 幂等，任何历史中段缺口自动自愈）\nyear = datetime.now().year\nstart = f'{year}0101'\nend = f'{year}1231'\n\ncount = 0\ncoverage = {}\nfor ex in ['SSE', 'SZSE']:\n    df = pro.trade_cal(exchange=ex, start_date=start, end_date=end)\n    time.sleep(0.5)\n    if df is not None and not df.empty:\n        for _, row in df.iterrows():\n            conn.execute(\n                'INSERT OR REPLACE INTO trade_cal (exchange, cal_date, is_open, pretrade_date) VALUES (?, ?, ?, ?)',\n                (row['exchange'], row['cal_date'], row['is_open'], row.get('pretrade_date'))\n            )\n        conn.commit()\n        count += len(df)\n        coverage[ex] = df['cal_date'].max()\nconn.close()\nprint(f'交易日历同步完成：覆盖 {count} 条记录（当年全量）')\nfor ex, mx in sorted(coverage.items()):\n    print(f'{ex} 最新日期: {mx}')\nyear_end = f'{year}1231'\nincomplete = [ex for ex, mx in coverage.items() if mx < year_end]\nif incomplete:\n    print(f'警告: {incomplete} 当年日历未发布完整（最新 < {year_end}），如需最新交易日请实时拉取')\n\"\n\n2. 打印结果摘要，包括最新日期和下一交易日信息；若出现\"警告\"提示当年日历不全，请明确告知用户哪些交易所数据不完整。",
